    "name": "jc1060p470c",
    "title": "Guition JC1060P470C",
    "description": "7-inch 1024x600 JD9165 on MIPI-DSI, GT911 touch, ES8311 sound: an ESP32-P4 with Wi-Fi and BLE in an ESP32-C6 on the same module",
