        "revision": "1.3",
        "notes": "The core is the module JC-ESP32P4-M3: ESP32P4NRW32, 16 MB flash, 32 MB PSRAM, an ESP32-C6. The chip of the board measured is of revision 1.3: a chip of revision 3 needs board_select.py --revision."
